TITLE CO2 equilibrium - find log IAP of CO2(g)

SOLUTION 1 Pure water at pH 7.0
    temp      25
    pH        7.0
    pe        4.0
    units     mol/L
    water     1.0  # kg

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    CO2(g)    -3.4    10.0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file     co2_output.sel
    -reset    false
    -si       CO2(g)
    -saturation_indices  true

END
